    "body": "**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\r\nGNL are making changes to how the cookie banner works in the EU/EEA (but not the UK).\r\n\r\n**Describe the solution you'd like**\r\nIf the user is in the UK, then everything continues as at present.\r\nIf the user is elsewhere in the EU/EEA and their ckns_policy cookie is not set to `2`, then we display the new cookie banner (https://github.com/bbc/psammead/issues/1957), which:\r\n* is an overlay for the whole page\r\n* contains new wording\r\n* sets the ckns_explicit cookie to `2` and the ckns_policy cookie to `111` when the user clicks/taps the 'accept' button\r\n\r\n**Describe alternatives you've considered**\r\nN/A\r\n\r\n**Testing notes**\r\n[Tester to complete]\r\n\r\nDev insight: Will Cypress tests be required or are unit tests sufficient? Will there be any potential regression? etc\r\n\r\n- [ ] This feature is expected to need manual testing.\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nAdd any other context or screenshots about the feature request here.\r\n",
